  "function_summary": {
    "summary": "Apache Commons Logging 是 Java 生态中的一个薄层日志适配库，提供统一的 Log 接口和 LogFactory 工厂，在运行时通过类路径发现机制自动寻找并选择底层日志实现（如 Log4j、java.util.logging、SLF4J 等），使应用代码与具体日志框架解耦。",
    "domain": "开发者工具 / 日志基础设施",
    "target_users": "Java 开发者、框架与库作者——需要日志输出但不想强绑定特定日志实现的场景",
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "日志门面",
        "description": "提供统一的 org.apache.commons.logging.Log 接口（含 trace/debug/info/warn/error/fatal 六个级别）和 LogFactory 工厂类，上层代码只依赖此 API，底层实现可在部署时灵活配置。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/main/java/org/apache/commons/logging/Log.java:63-220"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "动态日志发现",
        "description": "LogFactoryImpl 通过类路径扫描依次尝试 Log4j 1.x、JDK 1.4+ java.util.logging、SimpleLog 等实现；也支持通过 commons-logging.properties 或 ServiceLoader 机制显式指定实现。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/main/java/org/apache/commons/logging/impl/LogFactoryImpl.java:485-549"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "多日志后端适配",
        "description": "内建适配器：Log4JLogger（Apache Log4j 1.x）、Jdk14Logger（java.util.logging）、Jdk13LumberjackLogger（JDK 1.3 Lumberjack）、SimpleLog（控制台 stderr 输出）、AvalonLogger（Avalon 框架）、Log4jApiLogFactory（Log4j 2.x API）、Slf4jLogFactory（SLF4J）。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/main/java/org/apache/commons/logging/impl/Jdk14Logger.java",
          "src/main/java/org/apache/commons/logging/impl/Log4JLogger.java",
          "src/main/java/org/apache/commons/logging/impl/SimpleLog.java",
          "src/main/java/org/apache/commons/logging/impl/Slf4jLogFactory.java",
          "src/main/java/org/apache/commons/logging/impl/Log4jApiLogFactory.java"
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "Servlet 容器集成",
        "description": "提供的 ServletContextCleaner 组件在 Servlet 容器卸载 Web 应用时清理日志工厂的类加载器引用，避免内存泄漏。",
        "evidence": [
          "src/main/java/org/apache/commons/logging/impl/ServletContextCleaner.java"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "notes": "该库本身不实现日志输出，只是门面。所有实际的日志写入能力取决于运行时选中的后端实现。属于基础库，广泛被其他 Java 框架和库依赖。"
  },
